    {
      "id": "u_03bd4dda9f80f717c4dc07d4_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium does not support multiple users. In order to have two or more persons with their own set of notes, multiple server instances must be set up. It is also not possible to use multiple __TRILIUM_PH_0__sync__TRILIUM_PH_1__ servers.",
      "sourceHash": "03bd4dda9f80f717c4dc07d4840ff7e96baa4b8d93961d6e0e30cbf3b941e6d2",
      "context": "Multiple server instances",
      "contextHash": "47a618f02062622db30d2cdf22281cb8b0ae4b21583dc4ba46635ac1f55db13b",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Triliumはマルチユーザーをサポートしていません。2人以上のユーザーがそれぞれ自分のノートセットを持つには、複数のサーバーインスタンスを設定する必要があります。また、複数の__TRILIUM_PH_0__sync__TRILIUM_PH_1__サーバーを使用することもできません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4ba5264091a2ebe76ecefc90_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To allow multiple server instances on a single physical server:",
      "sourceHash": "4ba5264091a2ebe76ecefc9006c649d7e4dc87e20e51976381c4b19707b99d15",
      "context": "Multiple server instances",
      "contextHash": "47a618f02062622db30d2cdf22281cb8b0ae4b21583dc4ba46635ac1f55db13b",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "1台の物理サーバー上で複数のサーバーインスタンスを稼働させるには：",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_99f0a4957ff0cd3859bb8d75_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For __TRILIUM_PH_0__Packaged version for Linux__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or __TRILIUM_PH_2__Manually__TRILIUM_PH_3__, if starting the server manually just specify a different port and data directory per instance:",
      "sourceHash": "99f0a4957ff0cd3859bb8d756d5bee579b8c609cccb7672ce22272ea76160b85",
      "context": "Multiple server instances",
      "contextHash": "47a618f02062622db30d2cdf22281cb8b0ae4b21583dc4ba46635ac1f55db13b",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Linux向けパッケージ版__TRILIUM_PH_1__または__TRILIUM_PH_2__手動インストール__TRILIUM_PH_3__の場合、サーバーを手動で起動する際にインスタンスごとに異なるポートとデータディレクトリを指定してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9b72cd7a60dab08438b13761_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For a second instance:",
      "sourceHash": "9b72cd7a60dab08438b13761c260703424ee73d42ecd43f44b5abb3de6891414",
      "context": "Multiple server instances",
      "contextHash": "47a618f02062622db30d2cdf22281cb8b0ae4b21583dc4ba46635ac1f55db13b",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "2つ目のインスタンスの場合：",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
