    },
    {
      "id": "u_2732bfc0cd96e0df8cbec000_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For __TRILIUM_PH_0__Using Docker__TRILIUM_PH_1__, simply use two different containers, each with their own port binding and data directory.",
      "sourceHash": "2732bfc0cd96e0df8cbec0006cd6fc180b315d5a1b770cd30495f35f756d0a4d",
      "context": "Multiple server instances",
      "contextHash": "47a618f02062622db30d2cdf22281cb8b0ae4b21583dc4ba46635ac1f55db13b",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Dockerを使用する場合__TRILIUM_PH_1__は、それぞれ独自のポートバインディングとデータディレクトリを持つ2つの異なるコンテナを使用するだけです。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fb2cc9048feae56579a6a9dd_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For __TRILIUM_PH_0__On NixOS__TRILIUM_PH_1__, the only possible way is to use Docker OCI containers or at least one NixOS container with its own service definition.",
      "sourceHash": "fb2cc9048feae56579a6a9ddca6110fa70c8a5170d156857cab445b10101ceab",
      "context": "Multiple server instances",
      "contextHash": "47a618f02062622db30d2cdf22281cb8b0ae4b21583dc4ba46635ac1f55db13b",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__NixOSの場合__TRILIUM_PH_1__、唯一可能な方法はDocker OCIコンテナを使用するか、独自のサービス定義を持つ少なくとも1つのNixOSコンテナを使用することです。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
